cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, cite this repository and the upstream datasets listed in docs/DATA.md."
title: "Tamil 350M: a from-scratch Tamil language model and akshara-safe tokenizer"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Tamil 350M contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mvel95942-source/tamil-350m-research"
url: "https://github.com/mvel95942-source/tamil-350m-research"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-10"
abstract: >-
  Research record of a 380M-parameter Tamil-first language model trained from scratch on
  free Kaggle T4 GPUs, including an akshara-safe 32k tokenizer, a 927M-token
  contamination-controlled corpus, exact training configurations, raw logs, and a frozen
  15-case reliability evaluation that currently fails.
keywords:
  - Tamil
  - low-resource NLP
  - tokenization
  - language model
  - reproducibility
  - evaluation
